  "description": "Tot is a database file format for managing string data in a file. I would like to say markup-like database without indexing. It is using stream and position to efficiently track where the data is. And it is designed to handle massive data. But developer has full control over limitting the size of data in one tag. Eg. 65536 bytes in one tag. Tot is for replacing some jobs that database, JSON and XML do.",
